property:
验证类别：MLA包装器将请求展开为逐query行并向spy内核提交block_table和seq_lens；因果行只见前缀与本行之前token，非因果行提交完整长度。本项检查提交元数据，不执行注意力数值计算。 本项实际检查：L126: assert got == want, f'causal flatten is not causal: verify row r*query_len+t must get seq_len_r - {query_len - 1} + t entries.
  seq_lens {seq_lens}
  got      {got}
  expected {want}'；L135: assert rows == sorted(rows) and len(set(rows)) == query_len, f'request {r} rows must strictly increase, got {rows}'；L138: assert rows[-1] == seq_len, 'last row must see the full sequence'；L139: assert rows[0] == seq_len - (query_len - 1)；L140: assert all((n > 0 for n in rows)), f'non-positive KV extent in {rows}'
